Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, fighting for\Ntomorrow. Go catch what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.40,0:00:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life, run\Nlike a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong, believe\Nyou can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.20,0:00:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. I'll not stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do it again, you\Nknow what I mean, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can make my dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.12,0:00:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what is\NSomething is testing me every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:00:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.55,0:01:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I never wanna come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's fly away. The great\Nend of the unknown rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.68,0:01:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing up, blowing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is getting wilder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.70,0:01:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.70,0:01:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Another day, another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.00,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's never too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.18,0:01:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can do it, so can you. Only win out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.60,0:01:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We can let go together,\Nbaby, growing a rose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.26,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.56,0:01:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Party for tomorrow. Go\Nget what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.72,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.84,0:01:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Run like a wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.04,0:01:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe you can achieve your goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.12,0:01:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going. Roaring.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.16,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life, it's your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.42,0:01:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for your eyes that I\Nwant, but you're where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.50,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want more, anyone more,\Ncome on, open up the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.42,0:02:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my life. It's your life.\NShine like a star to be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're strong; just that\Nyou can't achieve your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.34,0:02:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's keep on going out of day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You make my day every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.70,0:04:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.52,0:04:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.16,0:04:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shembles.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.18,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, someone saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, nobody's up there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.46,0:04:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.37,0:04:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So is it over yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Give us an update, Guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been yelling too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.06,0:05:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a duty to fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The citizens are waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.26,0:05:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of announcer am I if\NI can't announce the winner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.34,0:05:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.70,0:05:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Look to the sky, Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch it fade, the birdcage,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.26,0:06:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and also, don't flamingos reign over us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.54,0:06:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We pushed it right over!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The birdcage is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.48,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh damn, he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky, the sky—it's clear again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.00,0:07:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.84,0:07:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,view that I see may look grim,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.30,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's not a town that's\Nbeen torn to shreds, not to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,me Rather, it is a land\Nof boundless freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.24,0:07:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One of infinite potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, Ola, it's really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dressrosa Defensive War.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.34,0:08:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Two thousand wicked pirates\Nfrom the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.94,0:08:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,versus the fateful warriors who\Ngathered here from far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Culminating in a duel between their leaders,\Nthe warlord Don Quixote do Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Versus the beloved gladiator, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.64,0:08:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.50,0:09:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.80,0:09:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.12,0:09:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay, we believe in you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.02,0:09:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're there already!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt! Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.40,0:09:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Don Quixote do Flamingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you've forgotten, I have not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.18,0:09:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus I've returned to take\Nmy place as your king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.28,0:09:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there something\Nwe've done to anger you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.30,0:09:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What could I possibly say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.64,0:09:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing can justify this. We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The kingdom is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We fell right into the flamingos trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.26,0:09:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.44,0:10:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wearing me down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.06,0:10:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Enunciate, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.28,0:10:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.48,0:10:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't start crying yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let the soldier die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Be strong, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.42,0:10:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I can promise you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to give Doflamingo\Nthe beating of his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.20,0:10:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.94,0:10:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.16,0:10:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.76,0:10:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:10:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopyland!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.24,0:11:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.66,0:11:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Robbyland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't scared at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid works, Sir Loopy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Remarkable indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.32,0:11:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.12,0:11:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice work, bros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.82,0:11:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all heroes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.66,0:11:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't squeeze so hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.12,0:11:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Every toy you see was\Nat one point a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.86,0:12:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are the little people from Tontata.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They will be fighting Doflamingo with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.72,0:12:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,brother i don't know what's going\Non but you shouldn't make a girl
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,cry i know i'm just a toy but i\Nmust protect her these useless tin
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.42,0:12:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,eyes of mine can't even shed a\Ntear for her he's been fighting on
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.64,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,his own for a whole decade but he\Nnever gave up and he never lost hope
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You filthy pirate! What did you do? Let\Nhim go, Rick. Here was the one burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,the kingdom down it wasn't me the king\Nwould never do such a thing regardless
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget what you did for me.\NTo a soldier, this battle is a chance for
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:13:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,us to reclaim our freedom and to restore\Nthe honor of our dethroned King Rick
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.22,0:13:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands offer you\Nhave taken enough from me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The collapse of the kingdom isn't\Nalways a tragedy for its people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In Dressrosa, even amongst\Nthe piles of rubble,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the citizens there shed\Ntears of joy and relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.84,0:13:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.68,0:13:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He really took down Dolph Lamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.64,0:14:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We have freedom in Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.24,0:14:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He took Heron the Batman! That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:03.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're free!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.12,0:14:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.00,0:14:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you going to finish me off?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No need. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.92,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Think we're just about\Ngood here, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.64,0:14:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You brothers are a bunch of softies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.72,0:14:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna hear what Ace said right before\Nwe handed his ass over to the Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.44,0:14:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was after our captain\Nthrashed him on Bonnaroo Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.46,0:15:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.82,0:15:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The clash between Straw\NHat and Doflamingo's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.68,0:15:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's gonna be on their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you contact the chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.96,0:15:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been trying to.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He only answers when he's feeling chatty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you'll get a real kick out of this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.20,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,once
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.48,0:15:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,he realized he
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,was to get executed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I remember it clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.76,0:15:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He said, "Don't tell my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.00,0:15:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dumb ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just how much weight his name carried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What a naive moron that kid was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.90,0:16:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course the navy would run\Nwith that story heroically.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.84,0:16:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought the vile\Nfire fist. As to just
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.96,0:16:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.14,0:16:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.89,0:16:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All I can think about\Nare his final moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.54,0:16:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It has haunted me every single\Nnight since the day that he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.74,0:16:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me\Nbecause I already know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.86,0:16:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, loser. Cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let that Devil Fruit\Nslip out of my grasp this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be a disgrace to my crew\Nif I came back empty-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.30,0:16:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking it one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.90,0:17:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're full of regret, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What did all that status and\Npower get you in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.84,0:17:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even use it\Nto save your own brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.94,0:17:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the hell were you\Nwhen it all went down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.62,0:17:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you catching some\NZs or something? Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't there for him when he needed\Nyou most, yet you called yourself family!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.84,0:17:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.38,0:17:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not be weighed down\Nby regrets any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.64,0:17:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.04,0:17:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.64,0:18:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to leave you, but\NAce here said you deserved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Sabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.48,0:18:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I noticed that Burgess\Nwas heading towards Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Figured you'd like to know that tidbit\Nof info, so I've been trying to call you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.16,0:18:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.99,0:18:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.81,0:18:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I took care of that ape already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.56,0:18:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you happen to\Nfind the list yet, Koala?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.54,0:18:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yes, I did. Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.56,0:18:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's call the ship and head back...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Already did! Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.66,0:18:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet up with Hack underground, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.58,0:18:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We're waiting on you! Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did that jackass just hang up on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't take it\Nout on me, Miss Koala.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.04,0:19:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We found the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.36,0:19:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got eight executives, and I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.40,0:19:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.31,0:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The top three as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.12,0:19:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Take caution!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We believe most of them\Nhave Devil Fruit powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.74,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You see Prism Stone just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay right here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.83,0:20:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.88,0:20:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Get yourself woman or her heart! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.30,0:20:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know if we called\NHQ yet? Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.76,0:20:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ishu instructed us to delay a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.60,0:20:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Admiral Maynard, the video\Ntransponder snail is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, let me have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Go grab another one and\Nmeet with the Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And follow Isho's orders\Nto the letter. Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, at the nearby Applebine Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.52,0:21:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.84,0:21:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.72,0:21:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it's a transmission\Nfrom Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's a speech from King Doflamingo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.78,0:21:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.60,0:21:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Report from Tres Rosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.04,0:21:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're broadcasting this\Nimportant declaration
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.60,0:21:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,to anyone who can receive this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.60,0:21:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a more example from the Navy HQ.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Maynard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.60,0:21:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Report from Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.38,0:21:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're broadcasting this\Nimportant declaration
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.86,0:21:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to anyone who can receive this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.92,0:21:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.46,0:21:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Please take a look at\Nthe following images.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.04,0:21:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.00,0:21:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are those piles of rubble?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What you see behind me is the\Ncurrent state of Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.74,0:22:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.44,0:22:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep calm and listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.08,0:22:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I will detail the events\Nthat took place this
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.50,0:22:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,afternoon involving the\Nwarlord Doflamingo. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nisho, I hope you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.46,0:22:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We are begging you, King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It took some time for\Nthe truth to get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.42,0:22:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As Muke Toys, we were unable to speak up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I cannot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.24,0:22:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, respect my wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.72,0:22:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with the misunderstanding\Nabsolved, I cannot return to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.22,0:22:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're the only ruler worthy\Nto lead, Dressrosa! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.62,0:22:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're done with all this violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.94,0:22:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, King Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We share your vision of a peaceful future!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.84,0:22:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We beg you! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.60,0:23:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your pleas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Under pressure, the Rick\Nfamily ideals shatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Has that not been proven by now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.86,0:23:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't care if we fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.58,0:23:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For the chance of being a bloodless\Nnation, we're happy to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We want a king who will resist wars,\Nand we know you're the man for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.14,0:23:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.05,0:23:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it results in failure,\Nwe'll take that chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.40,0:23:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares if we're poor?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.30,0:23:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make Dressrosa a peaceful\Nkingdom like we used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.82,0:23:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, King Rick, listen\Nto the cries of your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.08,0:23:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No one better suited to lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.64,0:23:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,As the fighting king, I'm not used to this
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.56,0:24:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Elisa Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.74,0:24:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,King Rick, please return\Nto the palace at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.10,0:24:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bunch of incoming calls\Nfrom our neighboring nations.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.94,0:24:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd like to talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.34,0:24:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.14,0:24:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.05,0:24:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I took it upon myself to\Nget the word out to people
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.54,0:24:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,when I told them a King\NRick would be returning,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.54,0:24:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,they all seem overjoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.82,0:24:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The King of Prudence?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.96,0:24:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you haven't changed that\Nmuch in a mere decade, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.50,0:24:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the old you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.28,0:24:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The man who'd give a firm stink-eye to\Nanyone even thinking about waging war, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.28,0:24:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all waiting on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.30,0:24:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.98,0:24:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,King of Miracles, Rick Doldo III!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.08,0:24:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend's a smart\Nman there, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This entire mess is Doflamingo's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.02,0:25:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I would hate to see you shoulder the
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.34,0:25:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,responsibility alone for\Nthe error in his judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.06,0:25:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That crooked pirate was unfit to rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.66,0:25:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But thanks to a broken arrangement\Nwith a bunch of convicts,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.74,0:25:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,the Seven Warlords system failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sadly, Dressrosa was forced to pay\Nthis price by the bloodstained hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.42,0:25:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They lost the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.72,0:25:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,People of the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.76,0:25:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and members of the royal family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.32,0:25:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.28,0:26:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,allow me to offer my\Nmost humble of apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.52,0:26:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,With deep regret, we've done\Nyou a terrible disservice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.54,0:26:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.00,0:26:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Admiral Isho is actually kneeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.62,0:26:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.88,0:26:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now this is wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.70,0:27:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy works directly\Nunder the government,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.90,0:27:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and one of their highly\Nrespected officials?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.28,0:27:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,is on the ground apologizing to King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.66,0:27:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened over there in Dressrosa?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The fall of the heavenly demon\Nwas due to some pirate alliance?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.90,0:27:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Take notes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.12,0:27:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't miss any details!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.02,0:27:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.96,0:27:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The false prosperity of the mighty Dressrosa,\Nthe unsavory secrets that they held.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.16,0:27:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The downfall of Don Quixote Doflamingo,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.40,0:27:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the world's most notorious\Nblack market broker,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.50,0:27:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and the Navy HQ Admiral\NFujitora's heartfelt prostration.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.36,0:27:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All these truths have been\Nfreed from the birdcage,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.04,0:27:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and for better or worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.10,0:27:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,they have been unleashed\Nupon the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.10,0:28:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy Admiral is bowing to King Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.56,0:28:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, they're recording it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.70,0:28:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.50,0:28:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's an admiral, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.42,0:28:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.60,0:28:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.22,0:28:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Something really nuts\Nhappened in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.04,0:28:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Please raise your head, admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.62,0:28:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.56,0:28:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you truly wish for\Nthe world to see this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.74,0:29:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,My word, don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.04,0:29:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this why you did not engage Doflamingo?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.70,0:29:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fujitora.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.61,0:29:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It was about time the\Nworld found out the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.76,0:29:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So I took one mighty gamble and\Nlet them do all the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.70,0:29:23.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It was what needed to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.96,0:29:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How could we let that warlord do\Nwhatever he pleased for all those years?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.78,0:29:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Then swoop in here and start\Npreaching about justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.16,0:29:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't sit right with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.02,0:29:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't play hero for a problem we made.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.70,0:29:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What we witnessed today was a kingdom that\Ncame together and seized its own justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.34,0:29:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be thanking the courageous\Nactions of pirates, gladiators,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.42,0:29:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,and your citizens.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.32,0:29:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The arduous battle is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.62,0:29:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.62,0:30:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's been difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.16,0:30:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Anti-Doflamingo Force!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.08,0:30:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Little King Rick Army!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.96,0:30:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill, sir commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.66,0:30:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your operation is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.64,0:30:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're disbanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.86,0:30:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.82,0:30:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Tank. The Navy must maintain face.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.94,0:30:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates and gladiators should hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.46,0:30:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The same goes for anyone without a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.06,0:30:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.28,0:30:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be my pleasure, King Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.04,0:30:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.95,0:31:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me that that whole\Nmix-up with Doflamingo leaving the
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.18,0:31:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Warlords was actually from some power\Neven higher than the lot of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.60,0:31:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to explain how\Nthat rat Doflamingo was
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.78,0:31:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,able to manipulate the world to his will?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.70,0:31:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This kind of malarkey needs to end,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.00,0:31:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,or else I'll be the\Nlaughingstock of the entire Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.24,0:31:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pull a stunt like that ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.12,0:31:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be wise to hold\Nyour tongue, Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.56,0:31:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your honor is of no\Nconcern to us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.12,0:31:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get a big head.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.60,0:31:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy merely acts as our public face.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.22,0:31:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Regardless, this whole affair was\Nplaced in Cypher-Pole's hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.16,0:31:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.07,0:31:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cypher-Pole, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.26,0:31:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's lay out the facts here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.42,0:31:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the Celestial Dragon's\Npuppet went right over your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.16,0:31:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all really okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.20,0:31:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your insolent mouth, Sakasuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.76,0:32:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Got anything to say about Kuzan? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.78,0:32:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How is someone as powerful as him allying\Nhimself with Blackbeard of all people?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.84,0:32:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Navy's reputation is already sullied.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.06,0:32:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That lackadaisical jackass\Nofficially resigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.52,0:32:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Who he chooses to partner with has\Nabsolutely jacked to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.18,0:32:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Five Elders! Fleet Admiral!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.78,0:32:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have urgent news.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.12,0:32:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's concerning the state\Nof the Don Quixote family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.04,0:32:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.56,0:32:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Defeated by Straw Hat and Law's Alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.10,0:32:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But in the process, Tress Rossa was\Nreduced to rubble completely. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.00,0:32:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.20,0:32:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.72,0:32:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.22,0:32:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, it doesn't end there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.20,0:33:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The broadcast transmission\Nthat was sent from
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.18,0:33:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Dressrosa quickly became\Nthe talk of every country.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.38,0:33:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's breaking news! Everybody\Nis spreading like wildfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.38,0:33:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It caused chaos amongst the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.98,0:33:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker was defeated, your majesty—he\Nwas the only weapon supplier we had.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.90,0:33:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.10,0:33:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,announce our surrender at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.20,0:33:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,once
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.22,0:33:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The war is finally over!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.90,0:33:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But we've already paid!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.88,0:33:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.12,0:33:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Joker, you slimy bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.66,0:33:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapons are somewhere at Dressrosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.54,0:33:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So is the Navy Admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.88,0:33:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget about it, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.08,0:33:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So our sweet devil\Nfruit deal fell through?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.60,0:33:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gonna happen to\Nmy smile agreement, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.38,0:34:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If only those meddling\Npunks had showed up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.06,0:34:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Tsuru.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.34,0:34:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't need to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.92,0:34:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.10,0:34:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Took the words right out of\Nmy mouth, Inspector General.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.24,0:34:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you have been on\Ntheir trail for quite some time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.86,0:34:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, by your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.34,0:34:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Want a cracker? I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.42,0:34:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Might I suggest this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.24,0:34:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Supreme is our special of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.32,0:34:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.90,0:34:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here, you old bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.06,0:34:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Now where'd that old lady go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, just a kid. Where are you? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.90,0:34:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, they took out Dolpholingo. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.34,0:34:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm proud to call them generation mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.48,0:35:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,High Priest Aruge!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.62,0:35:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,High Priest Aruge!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.64,0:35:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There's somebody up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.16,0:35:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,High Priest!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.68,0:35:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's just silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.44,0:35:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A remote cloud island\Nwhere no one can bother us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.64,0:35:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me when I say it's a bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.94,0:35:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, the cojones on them two guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.66,0:35:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like our little pirate Pallies\Nare making a name for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.54,0:35:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That means we'll be glomming Caesar\Nfor ourselves, boys, capisce?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.94,0:35:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, father!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.76,0:35:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't take him\Nlong to pull ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.58,0:35:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a huge triumph.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.92,0:36:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting, since Doflamingo's\Ngot connections with Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.94,0:36:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way he's not\Ngoing to be pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.06,0:36:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If this was intentional, they\Njust outed who they're after.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.66,0:36:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the four emperors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.00,0:36:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Facing the king of the\Nbeasts himself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.20,0:36:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least our target\Nis different than theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.22,0:36:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It saves us the hassle of\Nwasting manpower on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.30,0:36:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That still leaves\Nred-haired shanks all to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.20,0:36:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to keep focusing on that\Ngoal or it even traveled to Drake who
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.30,0:36:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,once made a name for himself by provoking\NKaido Do Flamingo killed your old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.60,0:36:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd I not know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.02,0:36:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's in the past now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.62,0:36:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I bear no grudge, damn dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.00,0:36:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You are ice cold
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.78,0:36:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not come help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.12,0:36:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This needs to be reported to the big man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.30,0:37:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And something tells me he won't be happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.26,0:37:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Kaino, you're not gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.90,0:37:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That schmuck Joker\Nscrewed up a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.34,0:37:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be getting smiles anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.40,0:37:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me, Esho.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.02,0:37:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know damn well\Nwhat it means for a ranking
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.82,0:37:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,official to admit an\Noversight on this scale!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.78,0:37:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you think to\Nfirst report this to HQ?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.86,0:37:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd followed protocol,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.60,0:37:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that the news would have
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.50,0:37:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,come out with a bit of\Na different spin on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.98,0:37:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.89,0:37:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Care to repeat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.86,0:37:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe the Seven Warlords\Nsystem should be abolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.70,0:37:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, I was there in person\Nwhen Crocodile's ruse was exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.40,0:37:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And the Navy couldn't do\Na damn thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.42,0:38:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for the\NStraw Hats back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.94,0:38:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Alabasta would have\Nbecome a pirate nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.42,0:38:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,just like Dressrosa is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.12,0:38:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But the government falsely declared\NCrocodile's downfall was due to the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.42,0:38:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I had a higher rank back then!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.58,0:38:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.78,0:38:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Fujitora really did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.40,0:38:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.68,0:38:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember how frustrated both of us were\Nafter what happened back in Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.92,0:38:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But this time, the Straw Hat's\Nachievement won't be covered up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.28,0:38:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It kind of feels like\Nretribution for that whole mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.44,0:38:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hand it to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.52,0:38:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't pull this off when\NI was in the same position.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.62,0:38:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely astonished.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.26,0:39:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got muffins.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.66,0:39:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall I make some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.96,0:39:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I said astonished, not famished.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.38,0:39:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, sis, we're hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.76,0:39:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Starby!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.67,0:39:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have his share then.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.16,0:39:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone want coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.40,0:39:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't give coffee to kids, silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.92,0:39:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want a muffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.44,0:39:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mr. Vegabunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.00,0:39:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you mean Vegabunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.46,0:39:22.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take just a few more days before\Nwe reach his lab, so hang tight, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.06,0:39:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.26,0:39:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The captain's so good with kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.14,0:39:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I wish I were five.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.26,0:39:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, enough, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.80,0:39:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still plenty of work to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.80,0:39:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.84,0:39:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I love it when you scold me, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.74,0:39:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called damage\Ncontrol, and it's common!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.88,0:39:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our superiors thought those pirates would\Nhelp maintain balance in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.90,0:40:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The government gave them authority,\Nand they made people suffer in turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.68,0:40:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you expect me to paint myself a hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.36,0:40:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,lying about solving a\Nproblem that we created.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.04,0:40:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This is about HQ's\Ncredibility and dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.18,0:40:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Isho, sir, I'd be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.88,0:40:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your egocentric actions have caused our\Nsystem of justice to lose all face today!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.18,0:40:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If your face is all you care about,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.38,0:40:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,then you should try a little\Nharder to keep it clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.86,0:40:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,If admitting to a wrongdoing\Nmeans your trust is gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.96,0:40:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'd say you never had\Nany in the first place, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.82,0:40:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You are going to clean this\Nentire disaster up, Fujitara.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.16,0:40:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not set foot in\Nany naval base in the entire
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,world until you bring me Straw Hat\Nand Trafalgar D. Water Law's heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.18,0:40:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.08,0:40:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.80,0:40:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just what I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.34,0:41:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I want some meat.
